flow "Decide, join, finish"
direction top-to-bottom
node Review shape=box role=backend tag=CHECK sublabel="Inspect the request"
node Gate shape=decision label="Ready?"
node Revise shape=box role=optional
node Join shape=merge
node Done shape=terminal
Review -> Gate
Gate => Join: yes
Gate -> Revise: no
Revise -> Join: reviewed
Join -> Done
highlight Gate
